{"content_hash": "2b14ae81014095cd", "version_id": 843, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Saudi Aramco buys 49% of AI firm HUMAIN from PIF", "title_zh": "沙特阿美从PIF手中买下AI公司HUMAIN 49%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 170, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "Saudi Arabia's biggest oil company is putting more money into artificial intelligence. Aramco will take a large share of HUMAIN, an AI startup that the country's wealth fund used to own alone.", "lead_zh": "沙特最大的石油公司正在向人工智能投入更多资金。沙特阿美将收购HUMAIN的大笔股份，这家AI初创企业此前由该国主权财富基金全资持有。", "preview": "HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup, announced the deal on the first day of this month. Until now, the company was fully owned by PIF", "preview_zh": "人工智能初创企业HUMAIN本月1日宣布了这笔交易。此前，该公司由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资持有。交易完成后，沙特阿美将持有HUMAIN 49%的股份，而PIF保留其余51%并继续控股。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 827, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 64.575, "size_bytes": 388368, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 194, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 66.15, "size_bytes": 397872, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 194, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 70.75, "size_bytes": 425520, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 194, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 61.025, "size_bytes": 367056, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 194, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 65.275, "size_bytes": 392544, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 194, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@a309d3e/content/data/versions/843.json", "paragraphs": ["HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup, announced the deal on the first day of this month. Until now, the company was fully owned by PIF, Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund. After the sale, Aramco will hold 49% of HUMAIN, although PIF will keep the remaining 51% and stay in control.", "Aramco is not paying only in cash. The company plans to hand over some key AI assets and also put in about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. Because of this, HUMAIN will gain both money and useful technology from the world's largest petrochemical company.", "The oil giant wants to turn advanced AI into real industrial tools. By using HUMAIN's AI infrastructure, Aramco hopes to strengthen its global network and improve how it runs its operations. However, the two sides did not say when the deal will close.", "The move shows how hard Saudi Arabia is pushing into technology. If the plan works, the country could become a bigger player in AI, while its oil business becomes more efficient at the same time."], "paragraphs_zh": ["人工智能初创企业HUMAIN本月1日宣布了这笔交易。此前，该公司由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资持有。交易完成后，沙特阿美将持有HUMAIN 49%的股份，而PIF保留其余51%并继续控股。", "沙特阿美并非只出钱。公司计划转让部分关键AI资产，并注资约99亿沙特里亚尔。因此，HUMAIN既能拿到资金，也能从这家全球最大石化企业获得有用的技术。", "这家石油巨头希望把先进AI变成真正的工业工具。借助HUMAIN的AI基础设施，沙特阿美希望强化其全球网络并提升运营效率。不过，双方没有说明交易何时完成。", "此举显示出沙特正大力进军科技领域。如果计划顺利，该国在AI领域的分量会更重，同时其石油业务也会变得更高效。"], "body": "HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup, announced the deal on the first day of this month. Until now, the company was fully owned by PIF, Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund. After the sale, Aramco will hold 49% of HUMAIN, although PIF will keep the remaining 51% and stay in control.\n\nAramco is not paying only in cash. The company plans to hand over some key AI assets and also put in about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. Because of this, HUMAIN will gain both money and useful technology from the world's largest petrochemical company.\n\nThe oil giant wants to turn advanced AI into real industrial tools. By using HUMAIN's AI infrastructure, Aramco hopes to strengthen its global network and improve how it runs its operations. However, the two sides did not say when the deal will close.\n\nThe move shows how hard Saudi Arabia is pushing into technology. If the plan works, the country could become a bigger player in AI, while its oil business becomes more efficient at the same time.", "body_zh": "人工智能初创企业HUMAIN本月1日宣布了这笔交易。此前，该公司由沙特主权财富基金PIF全资持有。交易完成后，沙特阿美将持有HUMAIN 49%的股份，而PIF保留其余51%并继续控股。\n\n沙特阿美并非只出钱。公司计划转让部分关键AI资产，并注资约99亿沙特里亚尔。因此，HUMAIN既能拿到资金，也能从这家全球最大石化企业获得有用的技术。\n\n这家石油巨头希望把先进AI变成真正的工业工具。借助HUMAIN的AI基础设施，沙特阿美希望强化其全球网络并提升运营效率。不过，双方没有说明交易何时完成。\n\n此举显示出沙特正大力进军科技领域。如果计划顺利，该国在AI领域的分量会更重，同时其石油业务也会变得更高效。", "text": "HUMAIN, an artificial intelligence startup, announced the deal on the first day of this month. Until now, the company was fully owned by PIF, Saudi Arabia's sovereign wealth fund. After the sale, Aramco will hold 49% of HUMAIN, although PIF will keep the remaining 51% and stay in control. Aramco is not paying only in cash. The company plans to hand over some key AI assets and also put in about 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. Because of this, HUMAIN will gain both money and useful technology from the world's largest petrochemical company. The oil giant wants to turn advanced AI into real industrial tools. By using HUMAIN's AI infrastructure, Aramco hopes to strengthen its global network and improve how it runs its operations. However, the two sides did not say when the deal will close. The move shows how hard Saudi Arabia is pushing into technology. If the plan works, the country could become a bigger player in AI, while its oil business becomes more efficient at the same time.", "vocab": [{"word": "artificial intelligence", "pos": "noun", "zh": "人工智能", "note": "常缩写为 AI", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "startup", "pos": "noun", "zh": "初创企业", "note": "指新成立的小公司", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sovereign wealth fund", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "主权财富基金", "note": "国家设立的投资基金", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份", "note": "take a share 表示持股", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "remaining", "pos": "adj", "zh": "剩余的", "note": "the remaining 51% 剩余51%", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hand over", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "移交、转让", "note": "常用短语动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "asset", "pos": "noun", "zh": "资产", "note": "常用复数 assets", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "infrastructure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "基础设施", "note": "此处指AI算力等基础系统", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strengthen", "pos": "verb", "zh": "加强", "note": "后接名词宾语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"w